-- monitor sleep, RDP/session disconnect. Four identical crashes 2026-08-15..18,
-- each one killing every pane in the window (and every Claude Code session in
-- them). OpenGL does not use wgpu at all, so it cannot reach that code path.
-- Full diagnosis: claude-local docs/windows/wezterm-webgpu-crash-runbook.md
